<section class="container" style="font-family: -apple-system-font,BlinkMacSystemFont, Helvetica Neue, PingFang SC, Hiragino Sans GB , Microsoft YaHei UI , Microsoft YaHei ,Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; text-align: left;"><h1 class="h1" data-heading="true" style="display: table; padding: 0 1em; border-bottom: 2px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em auto 1em; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.2); font-weight: bold; text-align: center; margin-top: 0 !important;">X 实测：NVIDIA API Key 获取流程</h1><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;">今天在 X 上看到一条很实用的实测帖，讲的是怎么拿到 <code class="codespan" style="font-size: 90%; color: #0f4c81; background: #eaf2fb; border: 1px solid rgba(15, 76, 129, 0.16); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;">NVIDIA API Key</code>。我又对照了 NVIDIA 官方文档，核心流程其实很短，普通开发者照着走就行。</p><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;">先说结论：入口不在一个单独的“开发者后台”，而是在 <code class="codespan" style="font-size: 90%; color: #0f4c81; background: #eaf2fb; border: 1px solid rgba(15, 76, 129, 0.16); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;">build.nvidia.com</code> 的模型页面里。</p><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;">最短流程是这 5 步：</p><ol class="ol" style="padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;"><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">打开 <code class="codespan" style="font-size: 90%; color: #0f4c81; background: #eaf2fb; border: 1px solid rgba(15, 76, 129, 0.16); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;">https://build.nvidia.com/explore/discover</code>，登录或注册 NVIDIA 账号。</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">进入任意一个 NIM / 模型页面。</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">找到页面里的 <code class="codespan" style="font-size: 90%; color: #0f4c81; background: #eaf2fb; border: 1px solid rgba(15, 76, 129, 0.16); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;">Get API Key</code>。</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">点击后继续点 <code class="codespan" style="font-size: 90%; color: #0f4c81; background: #eaf2fb; border: 1px solid rgba(15, 76, 129, 0.16); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;">Generate Key</code>。</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">复制生成的 key，并立刻保存。</li></ol><figure style="margin: 1.5em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;"><img src="../pierce-zhang-2045521315646599471/x-to-markdown/PierceZhang34/10-hermes-nvidia-minimax-m2-7/imgs/img-001-HGMdC4pbgAEeRDq.jpg" alt style="display: block; max-width: 100%; margin: 0.1em auto 0.5em; border-radius: 4px;"></figure><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;">这里有两个容易忽略的小点：</p><ul class="ul" style="list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;"><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• X 上的实测帖提到，注册过程中可能会用到手机验证码。</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• 帖子截图显示，生成出来的 key 有有效期，而且 key 只展示一次，没保存就得重新生成。</li></ul><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;">拿到 key 之后，常见用法就是把它配成环境变量：</p><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;"><code class="codespan" style="font-size: 90%; color: #0f4c81; background: #eaf2fb; border: 1px solid rgba(15, 76, 129, 0.16); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;">NVIDIA_API_KEY=&lt;your_key&gt;</code></p><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;">如果你是接 NVIDIA 的通用推理入口，常见 Base URL 是：</p><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;"><code class="codespan" style="font-size: 90%; color: #0f4c81; background: #eaf2fb; border: 1px solid rgba(15, 76, 129, 0.16); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;">https://integrate.api.nvidia.com/v1</code></p><figure style="margin: 1.5em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;"><img src="../pierce-zhang-2045521315646599471/x-to-markdown/PierceZhang34/10-hermes-nvidia-minimax-m2-7/imgs/img-002-HGMfYa6asAAVFU.jpg" alt style="display: block; max-width: 100%; margin: 0.1em auto 0.5em; border-radius: 4px;"></figure><figure style="margin: 1.5em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;"><img src="../pierce-zhang-2045521315646599471/x-to-markdown/PierceZhang34/10-hermes-nvidia-minimax-m2-7/imgs/img-003-HGMhGmDaUAAUkH9.png" alt style="display: block; max-width: 100%; margin: 0.1em auto 0.5em; border-radius: 4px;"></figure><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;">一句话总结：</p><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;">想拿 <code class="codespan" style="font-size: 90%; color: #0f4c81; background: #eaf2fb; border: 1px solid rgba(15, 76, 129, 0.16); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;">NVIDIA API Key</code>，记住三件事就够了：去 <code class="codespan" style="font-size: 90%; color: #0f4c81; background: #eaf2fb; border: 1px solid rgba(15, 76, 129, 0.16); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;">build.nvidia.com</code>，找 <code class="codespan" style="font-size: 90%; color: #0f4c81; background: #eaf2fb; border: 1px solid rgba(15, 76, 129, 0.16); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;">Get API Key</code>，生成后马上保存。</p><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;">来源说明：</p><ul class="ul" style="list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;"><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• X 实测帖：<code class="codespan" style="font-size: 90%; color: #0f4c81; background: #eaf2fb; border: 1px solid rgba(15, 76, 129, 0.16); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;">omegaAI (@PierceZhang34)</code></li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• NVIDIA 官方文档：VSS 与 AgentIQ 文档都明确提到 <code class="codespan" style="font-size: 90%; color: #0f4c81; background: #eaf2fb; border: 1px solid rgba(15, 76, 129, 0.16); padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 4px;">build.nvidia.com</code> 是拿 key 的入口</li></ul>





